	(text "Fullscale Input Level = (Ain+)-(Ain-) = 5.64 Vpp\nAin+ is between 3.91 and 1.09 V (Each leg swinging 2.82V)\nAin- is between 3.91 and 1.09 V\nBoth oscillate around 2.5V (Common mode level)\nThe DC bias (Common mode level) is sett using VQ or VCOM (one pin)\nVQ or VCOM nominal voltage is 2.5V\nFilt+ Nominal Voltage 5V (Positive voltage reference output)"
